{"overview":"در دنیای وسیع، هواپیماها به هم می‌پیوندند و نژادهای متعددی شکوفا می‌شوند. گردهمایی‌ای از استعدادهای فوق‌العاده شکل می‌گیرد که یکی پس از دیگری، موجودات برتر از سطوح پایین ظاهر می‌شوند. در این قلمرو بی‌کران، آن‌ها افسانه‌های جذابی می‌بافند که تحسین برانگیز است و به دنبال مسیر تسلط می‌روند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"In the vast world, planes converge and numerous races thrive. A gathering of extraordinary talents unfolds, where one after another, supreme beings from the lower planes come forth. In this boundless realm, they weave captivating legends that inspire admiration, pursuing the path to dominance.","tagline_en":"","runtime":22,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":104,"y":2023,"poster":"/4yp9KJiYAmLAfYLMWU4oxgHF1aL.jpg"}],"episodes":104,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["CN"],"cast":[{"name":"孙郎朗","role":"Mu Chen (voice)","photo":"/rgTaSMMAW33F5DqFclVTvtBfpKS.jpg","en":"Sun Lang Lang"},{"name":"李詩萌","role":"Luo Li (voice)","photo":"/i7hKjBsuxiMHuj3v68yWhbLXNbi.jpg","en":"Li Shimeng"},{"name":"江月","role":"Jiu You (voice)","photo":"/pNgEmfdVW3Pcy5yK1mj6kVn9pMG.jpg"},{"name":"賀文瀟","role":"Tang Qian Er (voice)","photo":"/bPsFFEEFjTFwqmM8SWrkHloBdjH.jpg","en":"He Wenxiao"},{"name":"张福正","role":"Liu Mu Bai (voice)","photo":"/gB3NHNnG2WSC1SnjGQ36Z9qD8Rp.jpg","en":"Zhang Fuzheng"},{"name":"柳眞顏","role":"Liu Yang (voice)","photo":"/16uWKQ3x1a49GfSxp7ylzUWXBJB.jpg","en":"Zhenyan Liu"},{"name":"劉琮","role":"Mu Feng (voice)","photo":"/wXl2Jxi9D2hj0DLoTzCGG1xf5jy.jpg","en":"Liu Cong"},{"name":"森中人","role":"Zhou Ye (voice)","photo":"/9eXFWbRt6DKjths7KdScJPTMDAY.jpg","en":"Sen Zhongren"},{"name":"史泽鲲","role":"Tan Qing Shan (voice)","photo":"/1O3W2fPIfMTMo6cFpUnxvhivJje.jpg","en":"Shi Zekun"},{"name":"Ян Жуй Синь","role":"Hong Ling (voice)","photo":"/rIMjMckAkSLPaFIc3T3sq1jHD6g.jpg"},{"name":"张沛","role":"YanDi XiaoYan (voice)","photo":"/ggAYlp5ZYDma79wH7unTW2LL3Ld.jpg","en":"Zhang Pei"}],"trailer":"","watch":{},"recs":["s106449","s79